8GHz<\/li><li>Tipo CPU<\/li><li>Octa-Core<\/li><li><strong>Pantalla<\/strong><\/li><li>Tama\u00f1o<\/li><li>11.0' (278.2mm)<\/li><li>Resoluci\u00f3n<\/li><li>1920 x 1200 (WUXGA)<\/li><li>Tecnolog\u00eda<\/li><li>TFT<\/li><li>N\u00famero de colores<\/li><li>16M<\/li><li><strong>C\u00e1mara<\/strong><\/li><li>C\u00e1mara principal - Resoluci\u00f3n<\/li><li>8.0 MP<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara principal - Autofocus<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara frontal - Resoluci\u00f3n<\/li><li>5.0 MP<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara principal - Flash<\/li><li>No<\/li><li>Resoluci\u00f3n de grabaci\u00f3n de v\u00eddeo<\/li><li>FHD (1920 x 1080)@30fps<\/li><li><strong>Almacenamiento\/Memoria<\/strong><\/li><li>Memoria_(GB)<\/li><li>8<\/li><li>Almacenamiento (GB)<\/li><li>128<\/li><li>Soporte de almacenamiento externo<\/li><li>MicroSD (hasta 1TB)<\/li><li><strong>Conectividad<\/strong><\/li><li>Versi\u00f3n USB<\/li><li>USB 2.0<\/li><li>Localizaci\u00f3n<\/li><li>GPS, Glonass, Beidou, Galileo, QZSS<\/li><li>Auriculares<\/li><li>3.5mm Stereo<\/li><li>Wi-Fi<\/li><li>802.11 a\/b\/g\/n\/ac 2.4G+5GHz, VHT80<\/li><li>Wi-Fi Direct<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Versi\u00f3n Bluetooth<\/li><li>Bluetooth v5.1<\/li><li>Perfiles Bluetooth<\/li><li>A2DP, AVRCP, DI, HID, HOGP, OPP, PAN<\/li><li>PC Sync.<\/li><li>Smart Switch (PC version)<\/li><li><strong>Sistema Operativo<\/strong><\/li><li>Android<\/li><li><strong>Sensores<\/strong><\/li><li>Aceler\u00f3metro, Giroscopio, Geomagn\u00e9tico, Hall, Luminosidad<\/li><li><strong>Especificaciones f\u00edsicas<\/strong><\/li><li>Dimensiones (AlxAnxProf, mm)<\/li><li>168.7 x 257.1 x 6.9<\/li><li>Peso (g)<\/li><li>480<\/li><li><strong>Bater\u00eda<\/strong><\/li><li>Capacidad de bater\u00eda (mAh, t\u00edpico)<\/li><li>7040<\/li><li>Extra\u00edble<\/li><li>No<\/li><li><strong>Audio y V\u00eddeo<\/strong><\/li><li>Formatos de reproducci\u00f3n de V\u00eddeo<\/li><li>MP4, M4V, 3GP, 3G2, AVI, FLV, MKV, WEBM<\/li><li>Resoluci\u00f3n de reproducci\u00f3n de V\u00eddeo<\/li><li